 wrap-break-word dark markdown-new-styling"><p data-start=3D"0" data-end=3D=
"36">That=E2=80=99s a really strong project idea.</p>
<p data-start=3D"38" data-end=3D"67">A good way to describe it is:</p>
<p data-start=3D"69" data-end=3D"169"><strong data-start=3D"69" data-end=3D=
"169">=E2=80=9CI want to create an application that uses AI to help generat=
e student schedules for my school.=E2=80=9D</strong></p>
<p data-start=3D"171" data-end=3D"309">For a 7th grade project, the smartes=
t move is to make it feel impressive <strong data-start=3D"244" data-end=3D=
"255">without</strong> making it too complicated. Also, one important truth=
:</p>
<p data-start=3D"311" data-end=3D"479"><strong data-start=3D"311" data-end=
=3D"351">Real student scheduling is very hard</strong>, because schools hav=
e lots of rules.<br data-start=3D"388" data-end=3D"391">
So for your project, it is better to build a <strong data-start=3D"436" dat=
a-end=3D"458">simplified version</strong> that shows the idea.</p>
<h2 data-section-id=3D"1236abp" data-start=3D"481" data-end=3D"506">What yo=
ur app could do</h2>
<p data-start=3D"508" data-end=3D"543">Your app could take in things like:<=
/p>
<ul data-start=3D"545" data-end=3D"685">
<li data-section-id=3D"8y0086" data-start=3D"545" data-end=3D"559">
<p data-start=3D"547" data-end=3D"559">student name</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id=3D"1eptnez" data-start=3D"560" data-end=3D"573">
<p data-start=3D"562" data-end=3D"573">grade level</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id=3D"1mlq2u1" data-start=3D"574" data-end=3D"592">
<p data-start=3D"576" data-end=3D"592">required classes</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id=3D"ez9r75" data-start=3D"593" data-end=3D"611">
<p data-start=3D"595" data-end=3D"611">elective choices</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id=3D"14k1klx" data-start=3D"612" data-end=3D"634">
<p data-start=3D"614" data-end=3D"634">teacher availability</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id=3D"1voo5s5" data-start=3D"635" data-end=3D"656">
<p data-start=3D"637" data-end=3D"656">class period limits</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id=3D"2586ib" data-start=3D"657" data-end=3D"685">
<p data-start=3D"659" data-end=3D"685">maximum students per class</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start=3D"687" data-end=3D"756">Then the AI or scheduling system cou=
ld try to create a schedule that:</p>
<ul data-start=3D"758" data-end=3D"899">
<li data-section-id=3D"1vrjs4r" data-start=3D"758" data-end=3D"800">
<p data-start=3D"760" data-end=3D"800">gives each student the classes they =
need</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id=3D"1ybyqym" data-start=3D"801" data-end=3D"848">
<p data-start=3D"803" data-end=3D"848">avoids putting two classes in the sa=
me period</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id=3D"s3j4th" data-start=3D"849" data-end=3D"871">
<p data-start=3D"851" data-end=3D"871">balances class sizes</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id=3D"15w3i9p" data-start=3D"872" data-end=3D"899">
<p data-start=3D"874" data-end=3D"899">fits teacher availability</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h2 data-section-id=3D"1yz28dq" data-start=3D"901" data-end=3D"917">Importa=
nt tip</h2>
<p data-start=3D"919" data-end=3D"998">For this project, the =E2=80=9CAI=E2=
=80=9D does not need to be some super advanced robot brain.</p>
<p data-start=3D"1000" data-end=3D"1058">You can say the AI is helping make=
 <strong data-start=3D"1035" data-end=3D"1054">smart decisions</strong> by:=
</p>
<ul data-start=3D"1060" data-end=3D"1165">
<li data-section-id=3D"16tajlc" data-start=3D"1060" data-end=3D"1084">
<p data-start=3D"1062" data-end=3D"1084">checking for conflicts</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id=3D"hilnqu" data-start=3D"1085" data-end=3D"1122">
<p data-start=3D"1087" data-end=3D"1122">choosing the best open class perio=
d</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id=3D"9wj14s" data-start=3D"1123" data-end=3D"1165">
<p data-start=3D"1125" data-end=3D"1165">recommending the most efficient sc=
hedule</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start=3D"1167" data-end=3D"1203">That is enough for a school projec=
t.</p>
<h2 data-section-id=3D"1xjl2m2" data-start=3D"1205" data-end=3D"1228">Best =
way to build it</h2>
<p data-start=3D"1230" data-end=3D"1286">You should make a <strong data-sta=
rt=3D"1248" data-end=3D"1268">simple prototype</strong> with these parts:</=
p>
<h3 data-section-id=3D"opx206" data-start=3D"1288" data-end=3D"1308">1. Inp=
ut section</h3>
<p data-start=3D"1309" data-end=3D"1325">Where you enter:</p>
<ul data-start=3D"1326" data-end=3D"1379">
<li data-section-id=3D"8y0086" data-start=3D"1326" data-end=3D"1340">
<p data-start=3D"1328" data-end=3D"1340">student name</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id=3D"16f88f1" data-start=3D"1341" data-end=3D"1348">
<p data-start=3D"1343" data-end=3D"1348">grade</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id=3D"1mlq2u1" data-start=3D"1349" data-end=3D"1367">
<p data-start=3D"1351" data-end=3D"1367">required classes</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id=3D"1itlym2" data-start=3D"1368" data-end=3D"1379">
<p data-start=3D"1370" data-end=3D"1379">electives</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 data-section-id=3D"rlihda" data-start=3D"1381" data-end=3D"1401">2. Rul=
es section</h3>
<p data-start=3D"1402" data-end=3D"1422">Where the app knows:</p>
<ul data-start=3D"1423" data-end=3D"1536">
<li data-section-id=3D"1dszvcy" data-start=3D"1423" data-end=3D"1460">
<p data-start=3D"1425" data-end=3D"1460">Math can only happen in periods 1=
=E2=80=933</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id=3D"18if9n7" data-start=3D"1461" data-end=3D"1484">
<p data-start=3D"1463" data-end=3D"1484">Art only has 20 seats</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id=3D"qge6yk" data-start=3D"1485" data-end=3D"1536">
<p data-start=3D"1487" data-end=3D"1536">Science teacher is only available =
periods 2 and 4</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 data-section-id=3D"yc9tot" data-start=3D"1538" data-end=3D"1559">3. Out=
put section</h3>
<p data-start=3D"1560" data-end=3D"1593">The app generates something like:<=
/p>
<ul data-start=3D"1595" data-end=3D"1700">
<li data-section-id=3D"1gkmvsm" data-start=3D"1595" data-end=3D"1611">
<p data-start=3D"1597" data-end=3D"1611">Period 1: Math</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id=3D"r2kxgx" data-start=3D"1612" data-end=3D"1631">
<p data-start=3D"1614" data-end=3D"1631">Period 2: Science</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id=3D"19mk2e" data-start=3D"1632" data-end=3D"1651">
<p data-start=3D"1634" data-end=3D"1651">Period 3: English</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id=3D"1ul074v" data-start=3D"1652" data-end=3D"1669">
<p data-start=3D"1654" data-end=3D"1669">Period 4: Lunch</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id=3D"1y19fqd" data-start=3D"1670" data-end=3D"1685">
<p data-start=3D"1672" data-end=3D"1685">Period 5: Art</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id=3D"199khv8" data-start=3D"1686" data-end=3D"1700">
<p data-start=3D"1688" data-end=3D"1700">Period 6: PE</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h2 data-section-id=3D"1q6e0g5" data-start=3D"1702" data-end=3D"1729">Easie=
st project versions</h2>
<h3 data-section-id=3D"heeyda" data-start=3D"1731" data-end=3D"1763">Option=
 1: Slides/mockup only</h3>
<p data-start=3D"1764" data-end=3D"1848">You design what the app would look=
 like and explain how it works.<br data-start=3D"1829" data-end=3D"1832">
This is easiest.</p>
<h3 data-section-id=3D"15f5s15" data-start=3D"1850" data-end=3D"1883">Optio=
n 2: Spreadsheet version</h3>
<p data-start=3D"1884" data-end=3D"1985">You use Google Sheets or Excel for=
mulas to simulate schedule generation.<br data-start=3D"1956" data-end=3D"1=
959">
This is medium difficulty.</p>
<h3 data-section-id=3D"1aap71z" data-start=3D"1987" data-end=3D"2019">Optio=
n 3: Simple website/app</h3>
<p data-start=3D"2020" data-end=3D"2170">You make a basic webpage where a s=
tudent picks classes and the app creates a schedule.<br data-start=3D"2106"=
 data-end=3D"2109">
This is the coolest option if you want something interactive.</p>
<h2 data-section-id=3D"e34p2c" data-start=3D"2172" data-end=3D"2206">What =
=E2=80=9CAI=E2=80=9D could specifically do</h2>
<p data-start=3D"2208" data-end=3D"2252">Instead of saying =E2=80=9CAI does=
 everything,=E2=80=9D say:</p>
<p data-start=3D"2254" data-end=3D"2383"><strong data-start=3D"2254" data-e=
nd=3D"2383">The AI helps solve scheduling problems by comparing class choic=
es, checking conflicts, and suggesting the best class periods.</strong></p>
<p data-start=3D"2385" data-end=3D"2418">That sounds smart and believable.<=
/p>
<h2 data-section-id=3D"170gbvt" data-start=3D"2420" data-end=3D"2447">Good =
project title ideas</h2>
<ul data-start=3D"2449" data-end=3D"2576">
