rt schools by saving time and helping with decision-making.</p>
<h3 data-section-id=3D"c4yi32" data-start=3D"4274" data-end=3D"4326">3. Sou=
rce about algorithms or rule-based systems</h3>
<p data-start=3D"4327" data-end=3D"4501"><strong data-start=3D"4327" data-e=
