<hr data-start=3D"6171" data-end=3D"6174">
<h1 data-section-id=3D"1lb5obe" data-start=3D"6176" data-end=3D"6231">Secti=
on 3: The Product / Outcome Gallery (Goal 4 &amp; 5)</h1>
<h2 data-section-id=3D"gpakty" data-start=3D"6233" data-end=3D"6257">The Fi=
nal Masterpiece</h2>
<p data-start=3D"6258" data-end=3D"6791">My final product is a working digi=
tal prototype called <strong data-start=3D"6313" data-end=3D"6333">SmartSch=
edule AI</strong>. The app generates student schedules by using AI-style lo=
gic. It takes into account required classes, elective choices, teacher avai=
lability, open periods, and class size limits. The prototype can generate 1=
0 random students and build schedules for them, and it can also create a sc=
hedule for a custom student entered by the user. My goal was not to create =
a full school scheduling program, but to show how technology could help sol=
ve a real school problem.</p>
<h2 data-section-id=3D"1ohs8sz" data-start=3D"6793" data-end=3D"6812">Befor=
e and After</h2>
<h3 data-section-id=3D"f7535r" data-start=3D"6813" data-end=3D"6823">Before=
</h3>
<p data-start=3D"6824" data-end=3D"6999">Before my project, scheduling was =
just something I thought of as a basic school task. I did not realize how m=
any decisions and limits are involved in making student schedules.</p>
<h3 data-section-id=3D"70fmzm" data-start=3D"7001" data-end=3D"7010">After<=
/h3>
<p data-start=3D"7011" data-end=3D"7314">After creating this prototype, I b=
etter understand how schools must balance many moving parts. My project sho=
ws that technology can reduce mistakes, save time, and support better organ=
ization. Even though my app is only a prototype, it demonstrates how AI-sty=
le systems could help schools in the future.</p>
<h2 data-section-id=3D"12icdio" data-start=3D"7316" data-end=3D"7344">Evide=
nce of Collaboration</h2>
<p data-start=3D"7345" data-end=3D"7700">I used feedback from adults and te=
acher guidance to improve my idea and make the project more realistic. I al=
so used feedback to simplify my goal so that the app would be clear, unders=
tandable, and achievable as a student prototype. This collaboration helped =
me focus on solving one real problem well instead of trying to build an unr=
ealistic full system.</p>
<hr data-start=3D"7702" data-end=3D"7705">
<h2 data-section-id=3D"3joxqb" data-start=3D"7707" data-end=3D"7747">Short =
