<p data-start=3D"7794" data-end=3D"8468"><strong data-start=3D"7794" data-e=
nd=3D"8468">SmartSchedule AI is a prototype app designed to help schools ge=
nerate student schedules more efficiently. Scheduling is a complex task bec=
ause schools must balance required classes, electives, teacher availability=
, class periods, and class size limits. My project uses AI-style logic to o=
rganize these factors and automatically create schedules for students. I ch=
ose this topic because scheduling affects many students and staff members a=
nd is an important part of school operations. This project shows how techno=
logy can be used to solve real educational problems, improve organization, =
and reduce errors, while demonstrating how AI could support schools in the =
future.</strong></p>
