<hr data-start=3D"2186" data-end=3D"2189">
<h2 data-section-id=3D"h9d6hv" data-start=3D"2191" data-end=3D"2219">Primar=
y Research Evidence</h2>
<p data-start=3D"2221" data-end=3D"2801">I conducted an interview with my s=
chool=E2=80=99s vice principal to better understand how scheduling works in=
 real schools. One key idea I learned is that scheduling is not just about =
fitting classes into periods. Schools also consider student preferences and=
 fairness. For example, a younger student who ranks a class as their first =
choice may be prioritized over an older student who ranks it lower. This sh=
owed me that real scheduling systems are more advanced than my prototype. I=
t helped me understand that my project is a simplified version of a much mo=
re complex real-world system.</p>
