<h1 data-section-id=3D"1as8mhx" data-start=3D"3551" data-end=3D"3584">=E2=
=9C=85 100-WORD SUMMARY (COPY/PASTE)</h1>
<p data-start=3D"3586" data-end=3D"4304">SmartSchedule AI is a prototype ap=
plication designed to help schools generate student schedules more efficien=
tly. Creating schedules is a complex process because schools must balance r=
equired classes, electives, teacher availability, class periods, and class =
size limits. My project uses AI-style logic to organize these factors and a=
utomatically generate schedules for students. Through research and an inter=
view with a school administrator, I learned that real scheduling systems al=
so consider student priorities and fairness. This project demonstrates how =
technology can help solve real problems in schools, improve organization, a=
nd reduce errors while showing how AI could support education systems in th=
e future.</p>
