<p data-start=3D"161" data-end=3D"232"><strong data-start=3D"161" data-end=
=3D"179">Project Title:</strong><br data-start=3D"179" data-end=3D"182">
SmartSchedule AI: A Student Scheduling Prototype</p>
<p data-start=3D"234" data-end=3D"302"><strong data-start=3D"234" data-end=
=3D"253">Global Context:</strong><br data-start=3D"253" data-end=3D"256">
