<p data-start=3D"304" data-end=3D"931"><strong data-start=3D"304" data-end=
=3D"325">Mission Abstract:</strong><br data-start=3D"325" data-end=3D"328">
My project is a prototype app called SmartSchedule AI. It is designed to he=
lp schools generate student schedules faster and with fewer mistakes. Creat=
ing schedules is difficult because schools must balance required classes, e=
lectives, teacher availability, class periods, and class size limits. My pr=
ototype uses AI-style logic to organize these factors and create schedules =
automatically. I chose this project because scheduling is an important scho=
ol task that affects many students and staff members. This project shows ho=
w technology can be used to solve real school problems and improve efficien=
cy.</p>
