<hr data-start=3D"1020" data-end=3D"1023">
<h1 data-section-id=3D"13utjxx" data-start=3D"1025" data-end=3D"1072">=E2=
=9C=85 SECTION 1: THE PROCESS JOURNAL (Goal 1 &amp; 4)</h1>
<h2 data-section-id=3D"1ehphcv" data-start=3D"1074" data-end=3D"1104">The B=
rainstorming Archive</h2>
<p data-start=3D"1105" data-end=3D"1703">At the beginning of this project, =
I wanted to create something using technology that solves a real problem. I=
 thought about problems in schools that affect many people. One problem I f=
ocused on was student scheduling. Making schedules is complicated because s=
tudents need required classes, electives, and teachers are only available a=
t certain times. I realized this would be a good challenge because it combi=
nes school needs with technology. My idea was to create an application that=
 could take student information and automatically build a schedule using ru=
les, similar to a simplified AI system.</p>
<hr data-start=3D"1705" data-end=3D"1708">
<h2 data-section-id=3D"1f1a1nu" data-start=3D"1710" data-end=3D"1737">The C=
