<p data-start=3D"1739" data-end=3D"1912"><strong data-start=3D"1739" data-e=
nd=3D"1749">Week 1</strong><br data-start=3D"1749" data-end=3D"1752">
I brainstormed project ideas and decided to focus on a school-related probl=
em. I chose scheduling because it affects every student and is difficult to=
