<p data-start=3D"5374" data-end=3D"5911">I conducted an interview with my s=
chool=E2=80=99s vice principal to better understand how scheduling works in=
 real schools. I learned that scheduling is not just about fitting classes =
into periods, but also about fairness and priorities. For example, a younge=
r student who ranks a class as their first choice may be prioritized over a=
n older student who ranks it lower. This showed me that real scheduling sys=
tems are more advanced than my prototype. It helped me understand that my p=
roject is a simplified version of a much more complex system.</p>
<hr data-start=3D"5913" data-end=3D"5916">
<h2 data-section-id=3D"2stamb" data-start=3D"5918" data-end=3D"5958">Langua=
